	(descr "noknok mezzanine spring pins, interface rev 2, cluster C: BAT WIRELESS BWCD-L5.5W2.0H3.0 SMD pogo pins (LCSC C2826550; body D2.0 x 4.0 mm, plunger D1.5, free length 5.5 mm, stroke 1.5 mm, 70 gf, 1.5 A, 30 V, 30 mOhm, 10k cycles), pads D2.6 with paste. EXACT Y MIRROR of noknok_Mezzanine_C_Pads_M2.5 (generated by tools/sync_mezz.ps1 - do not hand-edit; edit the _Pads footprint and re-run). Place on the mezzanine TOP side, origin on the mounting hole that meets the hub hole, rotation 0. Includes that M2.5 hole. Board-to-board 4.5 mm (1.0 mm compression) on M2.5 x 4.5 standoffs; mate the boards straight, guided by the standoffs.")
